Use a complete UTC publication window:

    target_date 00:00:00 UTC
    through
    target_date 23:59:59 UTC

Example:

If extraction runs on:

    2026-08-31

the target video publication date is:

    2026-08-28

The search request must use:

    publishedAfter
    publishedBefore

based on this dynamically calculated window.

Do NOT hard-code dates.

Store both:

