19. OUTLIER DETECTION
============================================================

Implement outlier detection over the FINAL POPULATION.

Apply it independently to:

    reach_ratio
    interaction_density

Use:

    outlier if value > mean + (2 * standard_deviation)

That is:

    μ + 2σ

Do not use the semantic score for statistical outlier detection unless it is specifically required for the stored top-outlier record.

Each video should be able to be identified as an outlier for:

    reach_ratio
    interaction_density

Retain the outlier information for auditing/downstream analysis.

